  "description": "App passwords for Elarion (ADR-0111): IAppPasswords issues a per-user, named, scoped credential for calendar apps and feeds (a prefix plus 256 bits from the CSPRNG, returned once, stored only as its SHA-256), lists and revokes them, and verifies a secret with a throttled last-use write; the IAppPasswordStore seam takes the EF store or the application's own. BCL cryptography only, no reflection.",
